# Direct development tools for the lanpull client.
# The client runtime uses the standard library only; nothing here is shipped.
# This is the intent file; requirements-dev.txt is generated from it with
# hashes and the full transitive set:
#
#   uv pip compile --generate-hashes --python-version 3.11 \
#       requirements-dev.in -o requirements-dev.txt
#
# Install with `make setup` (uv) or
# `uv pip install -r requirements-dev.txt`.

